{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CS Manager is a passion project over two years in the making, to give eSports a deep and tactical manager game. Choose your team and take them to  the top of the circuit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose between more than 140 teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.poster.avif?t=1773707369\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.webm?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.mp4?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the most elite pros to the unorganized amateur leagues, choose your team and take them all the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to create your own organization with your own nationality, and work your way up from the very bottom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and priorities are not limited to players, you must deal with staff, the expectations of your owner, finances, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/c27099fd5983ae1ecebaa902d05a0cd7.poster.avif?t=1773707369\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/c27099fd5983ae1ecebaa902d05a0cd7.webm?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/c27099fd5983ae1ecebaa902d05a0cd7.mp4?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill is not everything when signing players. For the best setup, you must take roles, maps and positions into consideration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your teams cohesion will depend on each players personality, the languages they can speak, and the decisions you make around them. The most resilient players can handle a tough schedule with lots of travel, while you must carefully plan your events and matches around others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect your map pool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.poster.avif?t=1773707369\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.webm?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.mp4?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your team in action on 8 different maps, each with its own characteristics and tactical quirks.\u00a0Your timeouts and instructions are played out in real time, and your success depend on them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your in-game-leader, sniper, the pace at which your team plays, how to attack and defend each site, and decide on many other tactical elements to optimize your teams approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering all maps at the same time is tough, prioritize depending on your teams abilities, and your players preferences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist CS Manager now, and stay tuned for more updates and release in 2026! You can also check out our Discord</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418500?t=1773707369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/9e1f204aa29f6c4c08a1397e333b736be2a254d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773707369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/0c763c1893c94e85f810bda5a54cb66149e3a5f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773707369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/0c763c1893c94e85f810bda5a54cb66149e3a5f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773707369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CS Manager is a passion project over two years in the making, to give eSports a deep and tactical manager game. Choose your team and take them to  the top of the circuit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose between more than 140 teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.poster.avif?t=1773707369\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.webm?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/79a3f53997517e055c2acc6110cdd230.mp4?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas