0/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.poster.avif?t=1773707369\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.webm?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/extras/efe1b6e3c06d42c81f20b46934db25c5.mp4?t=1773707369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your team in action on 8 different maps, each with its own characteristics and tactical quirks.\u00a0Your timeouts and instructions are played out in real time, and your success depend on them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your in-game-leader, sniper, the pace at which your team plays, how to attack and defend each site, and decide on many other tactical elements to optimize your teams approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering all maps at the same time is tough, prioritize depending on your teams abilities, and your players preferences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist CS Manager now, and stay tuned for more updates and release in 2026! You can also check out our Discord</strong></h2>","developers":["Crumana"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418500/350694989db15cad4ee2943b1e35b15d7e8234e2/header.jpg?t=1773707369","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3418500/1773951148/c26